COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."email_mailboxes"."warmup_day" IS 'Count of distinct days with >=1 CONFIRMED-DELIVERED warmup send. Derived from email_warmup_sends by trg_warmup_send_rollup — NOT calendar days since warmup_start_date (which is what it used to mean, and why it lied).';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."email_mailboxes"."engagement_score" IS '(replies*5 + opens) / sent over the last 50 sends. Drives Phase 8.4.1 daily-limit modulation.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."email_mailboxes"."warmup_enabled" IS 'Opt into the warmup mesh. Independent of status: a mailbox can be status=ready (sending cold at full volume) while warming in the background.';



