COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."lb_discovered_companies"."dm_attempt_count" IS 'Number of harvestapi/linkedin-company-employees runs spent on this company.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."lb_discovered_companies"."dm_last_attempted_at" IS 'Timestamp of the most recent harvestapi DM scrape attempt.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."lb_discovered_companies"."dm_dead" IS 'TRUE when this company has been permanently marked unscrapeable (3 consecutive zero-result harvests, no LinkedIn URL resolvable, etc.). Recover/rerun paths must skip these.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."lb_discovered_companies"."dm_dead_reason" IS 'Why dm_dead was set (apify_returned_zero_x3, no_linkedin_no_website, etc.).';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."lb_discovered_companies"."revenue_range" IS 'Annual revenue band in the provider''s own vocabulary (MoltSets: "$1M - $5M", "Above $50M", …). NULL when unknown — SignalBase does not return revenue.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."lb_discovered_companies"."firmographics_checked_at" IS 'When enrich-signal-company-firmographics last attempted this company. Stamped on a MISS too — that is the point: it stops a company the provider does not know from being re-bought every run. NULL = never attempted.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."lb_discovered_companies"."firmographics_source" IS 'Where the firmographics came from: lead_pool (free) | moltsets_reverse_linkedin (lookup quota) | moltsets_search_companies (search quota, opt-in) | NULL when the attempt found nothing.';



