COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."linkedin_campaigns"."autopilot_config" IS 'AI autopilot config matching email sequence format: { enabled, rules, require_approval, max_auto_replies }';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."linkedin_campaigns"."auto_enroll_new_members" IS 'When true, a cron job continuously enrolls newly eligible contacts (from the campaign''s lead list, including smart lists) into campaign_lead_progress. Mirrors initialize_campaign_leads exclusion rules.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."linkedin_campaigns"."lead_list_ids" IS 'Lead sources for the campaign — union of static/smart lead_lists. Source of truth for enrollment; lead_list_id is kept in sync as lead_list_ids[1] for legacy readers.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."linkedin_campaigns"."enroll_filter_criteria" IS 'SmartListFilterCriteria applied to lead-list members before enrollment (initial fill AND the auto-enroll cron). Empty object = enroll everyone, the pre-filter-step behaviour.';



