COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."youtube_scripts"."hook_variations" IS 'Array of hook options with viral scores and retention estimates';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."youtube_scripts"."research_insights" IS 'Research insights including ICP, product angles, content angle insights, and minimal patterns. Structure: {icp: {demographics, psychographics, pain_points, desires, buying_motivations}, product_angles: {primary_angle, emotional_triggers, urgency_factors}, content_angle_insights: {pain_points_addressed, desires_targeted, target_audience}, research_patterns: []}';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."youtube_scripts"."predicted_retention_curve" IS 'Predicted viewer retention curve based on scene patterns';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."youtube_scripts"."generation_flow" IS 'Which flow was used to generate this script: wizard, from_idea, quick_create, bulk, manual';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."youtube_scripts"."generation_config" IS 'JSONB snapshot of generation configuration for reproducibility and analytics';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."youtube_scripts"."bulk_job_id" IS 'Reference to bulk generation job if this script was generated in a batch';



